  "aboutUs": {
    "history": {
      "p1": "Blockchain club lautech, founded 2020 by a group of innovatives driven by the mission to teach beyond technical knowledge, to demystify the blockchain and make it accessible to beginners while also providing advanced learning opportunities for more experienced members.",
      "p2": "The club was established as a collaborative learning community where members could explore the fundamentals of blockchain technology, understand how cryptocurrencies function, and examine real world applications across every sector.",
      "p3": "Through structured activities including workshops, seminars, hackathons and collaborative projects, blockchain club lautech fosters an environment that encourages innovation, critical thinking, and skill development."
    },
